# Client data never goes into version control. Raw exports carry payroll and
# revenue detail, and the inputs workbook carries the same figures derived.
# The _demo client is synthetic and is the one deliberate exception; _template
# holds empty folders only.
#
# Patterns match directory *contents* rather than the directories themselves,
# because git will not descend into an excluded directory to honour a negation.
clients/*/raw/**
clients/*/output/**
clients/*/config/client-config.xlsx
!clients/_demo/raw/**
!clients/_template/raw/**
!clients/_template/config/client-config.xlsx
!clients/*/output/.gitkeep

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
~$*.xlsx
